  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 FAQs\n\n### What file types can I upload invoices and receipts in Capium 365?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 1 Apr, 2025 at 11:48 AM\n\n\t\tThe file types that are supported and you can upload in Capium 365 are: JPG, JPEG, PNG, GID, BMP, AVIF, HEIF, WEBP, PDF. This is the same for purchase invoices and invoices.\n\nThere is no restriction on the file size you can upload in.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
